7648903,2023-10-06,Mortgage,Conventional home mortgage,Applying for a mortgage or refinancing an existing mortgage,Delays in the application process,"I am writing to file a formal complaint against United Wholesale Mortgage ( UWM ) and XXXX XXXX XXXX regarding significant delays in closing my mortgage loan, unjust charges I have incurred as a result of these delays, and a lack of transparency and communication throughout the loan process. My experience with these entities has been exceptionally frustrating and financially burdensome. 

