7736272,2023-10-22,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"Retaliation tactics used by former lenders/credit card company resulting in inaccurate and conflicting data on my Credit Report with all 3 Bureaus. Significantly impacting my livelihood along with ability to obtain housing, transportation, and other life necessities.

What is most concerning is that the financial institution appears a bit emotional, where legal and ethical practices should take priority, especially compliance with Federal Law. A sort of double-dipping and whipping is the best way to describe it. 

